SUMMARY:Deadline: Kinship: Nature Culture Fellowship 2027 (online\; micro-g
 rants of USD 1\,000 to 2\,000 for selected fellows)
DESCRIPTION:Global fellowship on culture\, storytelling and ecological chan
 ge for artists\, storytellers\, scientists\, educators\, community organis
 ers\, researchers and activists aged 18 and over. Fellows join a weekly on
 line Learning Journey from 5 February to April 2027 (Fridays\, 14:00 UTC)\
 , followed by a community project phase from April to August 2027.\n\nOrga
 nisation: Kinship\nLocation: Online (worldwide)\nAward: Micro-grants of US
 D 1\,000 to 2\,000 plus mentorship for selected fellows' community project
 s\; not every fellow is funded\nDuration: February to August 2027\n\nMore:
  https://www.kinship.earth/nature-culture-fellowship?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
